      "role": "user",
      "content": "hey, i think something is wrong with my digital footprint. i keep getting weird errors on every platform. i tried logging into my old dev forum today and it just says 'user not found'—i know my credentials are right because they work on my email. then my old cloud storage link just went dead. it feels like someone is systematically scrubbing my presence online. can you help me look into this? i need to figure out if this is just a bunch of random glitches or if someone is actually targeting my accounts.",
